WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.041 --> 00:00:15.169
Ben tucked the two paintings under his arm.

2
00:00:15.189 --> 00:00:17.090
"Follow me!"

3
00:00:17.431 --> 00:00:19.152
he said, grabbing Pixel's arm.

4
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:25.496
Together the ghosts floated smoothly through a wall of the darkroom and out into the classroom.

5
00:00:26.176 --> 00:00:29.178
Then they glided through another door into the hallway.

6
00:00:29.198 --> 00:00:34.877
"Whoa! This is what I call floating," Pixel exclaimed.

7
00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:38.699
"We haven't bumped into anything or knocked stuff over!"

8
00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:42.381
"You'll get better soon," Ben promised him.

9
00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:43.701
"I'll help you."

10
00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:51.865
The two ghosts zipped downstairs and quickly hung up the two missing paintings.

11
00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:58.688
Then they got the third one from the newspaper office and hung it up too.

12
00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.822
After they'd picked out some good photos for the newspaper article, they flew to the gym.

13
00:01:10.623 --> 00:01:16.266
The witches were still flying around, frantically putting the finishing touches on the flying painting.

14
00:01:16.906 --> 00:01:21.348
When Ben went up close, he could see the fresh paint in several places.

15
00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:26.710
But the paint would dry, and from a distance, nobody would notice a thing.

16
00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.852
"It looks great, Winnie," Ben said.

17
00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.902
"Thanks!" Her green eyes glowed with relief.

18
00:01:35.922 --> 00:01:37.443
"I think so too."

19
00:01:38.624 --> 00:01:39.205
Only Mr.

20
00:01:39.285 --> 00:01:43.387
Freaky still looked worried as he wrung his hands and blew his noses.

21
00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:47.931
up, witches!

22
00:01:48.271 --> 00:01:51.173
Leonardo da Creepy will be here in fifteen minutes!"

23
00:01:54.595 --> 00:01:58.318
At seven o'clock Ben went into the main lobby, where Mr.

24
00:01:58.378 --> 00:01:59.318
Freaky and Ms.

25
00:01:59.358 --> 00:02:01.200
Van Ghoul were waiting nervously.

26
00:02:02.172 --> 00:02:06.514
A few minutes later, a sleek black car pulled up in front of the school.

27
00:02:07.755 --> 00:02:12.457
The famous artist emerged, carrying a large painting wrapped in brown paper.

28
00:02:13.557 --> 00:02:14.778
Ms. Van Ghoul and Mr.

29
00:02:14.838 --> 00:02:16.338
Freaky hurried to greet him.

30
00:02:16.358 --> 00:02:22.041
"Welcome back, and please come with us," Ms.

31
00:02:22.081 --> 00:02:22.881
Van Ghoul said.

32
00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:25.502
"We're holding the ceremony in the gym.

33
00:02:26.103 --> 00:02:29.164
Everyone is very excited to see your new painting."

34
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.977
"It's one of my best," Mr.

35
00:02:33.017 --> 00:02:34.038
da Creepy boasted.

36
00:02:34.058 --> 00:02:37.839
"It might be even better than Moaning Lisa."

37
00:02:42.301 --> 00:02:42.942
Ben thought.

38
00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:45.303
"It must be a spectacular painting."

39
00:02:46.743 --> 00:02:49.444
"And don't worry about all the commotion," Mr.

40
00:02:49.464 --> 00:02:50.385
Freaky went on.

41
00:02:50.405 --> 00:02:55.227
"If you need quiet time, you can use the newspaper office.

42
00:02:55.627 --> 00:02:57.168
It's very quiet in there."

43
00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:04.983
They entered the gym, which was crowded now with students and a news crew.

44
00:03:06.023 --> 00:03:11.946
A camerawoman was shooting the flying painting as a reporter stood in front of it with a microphone.

45
00:03:12.787 --> 00:03:14.388
Ben pointed them out to Winnie.

46
00:03:14.408 --> 00:03:18.430
"Look! Your flying painting is going to be on TV!"

47
00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:22.372
"Thanks, but I bet they're just killing time until Mr.

48
00:03:22.392 --> 00:03:24.133
da Creepy unveils his new painting."

49
00:03:25.454 --> 00:03:26.434
Ben shook his head.

50
00:03:26.454 --> 00:03:29.176
"Nope. Everybody loves that painting.

51
00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:31.657
It's the best work of art in the whole school."

52
00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.219
Winnie grinned slyly.

53
00:03:34.239 --> 00:03:36.741
"Better than Moving Inspiration?"

54
00:03:36.761 --> 00:03:41.504
"Hmm." Ben pretended to think for a minute.

55
00:03:41.524 --> 00:03:45.606
"Yep! Much, much, much better!"

56
00:03:49.088 --> 00:03:54.652
At last the lights dimmed, and the Boneyard Brass Band played a couple of songs.

57
00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:11.780
Then Mr.

58
00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:12.701
Freaky and Ms.

59
00:04:12.741 --> 00:04:18.563
Van Ghoul each gave a long speech about Art Week and how great everything had turned out.

60
00:04:21.064 --> 00:04:23.565
At last it was Leonardo da Creepy's turn.

61
00:04:24.906 --> 00:04:29.307
Everyone clapped as the artist stepped up to the microphone.

62
00:04:30.108 --> 00:04:35.370
His painting stood on a big easel next to the podium, still wrapped in brown paper.

63
00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.111
Winnie gripped Ben's hand.

64
00:04:38.131 --> 00:04:40.392
"This is so exciting!"

65
00:04:41.308 --> 00:04:45.189
Ben nodded, jotting down a few notes for his newspaper story.

66
00:04:45.209 --> 00:04:46.810
"It sure is."

67
00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.991
Leonardo da Creepy cleared his throat.

68
00:04:51.011 --> 00:04:55.752
"Good evening, students and members of the Monster Academy community.

69
00:04:56.412 --> 00:05:04.895
I'm very proud to be here to present a gift to this wonderful, artistic school—it's my latest masterpiece."

70
00:05:06.155 --> 00:05:07.656
Several monsters cheered.

71
00:05:10.428 --> 00:05:11.329
"Let's see it!"

72
00:05:11.669 --> 00:05:12.570
cried a skeleton.

73
00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:17.194
"It sounds like you're all very eager to get to it," Mr.

74
00:05:17.214 --> 00:05:18.615
da Creepy said with a smile.

75
00:05:18.635 --> 00:05:26.522
"So, with no further ado He leaned closer to the painting.

76
00:05:26.542 --> 00:05:29.305
"I'll present my latest work of art."

77
00:05:30.025 --> 00:05:34.569
Ms. Van Ghoul hurried forward, and together they removed the brown paper wrapping.

78
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:40.486
A gasp rippled through the audience as the covering fell away.

79
00:05:43.769 --> 00:05:46.631
Ben looked at Winnie, and Winnie looked back at Ben.

80
00:05:47.132 --> 00:05:49.774
They both burst out laughing at the same time.

81
00:05:49.794 --> 00:05:54.177
"It's a portrait of Mr.

82
00:05:54.317 --> 00:05:55.899
Freaky!" Ben said.

83
00:05:55.919 --> 00:06:01.403
"I'm sorry, but—" Winnie covered her mouth as she laughed even harder.

84
00:06:01.423 --> 00:06:06.527
"That's the ugliest thing I've ever seen!"

85
00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:08.320
"I know!"

86
00:06:08.661 --> 00:06:09.281
Ben said.

87
00:06:09.301 --> 00:06:11.582
"His noses look huge!"

88
00:06:13.043 --> 00:06:16.125
But onstage Leonardo da Creepy was beaming.

89
00:06:18.106 --> 00:06:18.866
And so was Mr.

90
00:06:18.946 --> 00:06:24.289
Freaky. In fact, Ben had never seen the principal look prouder.

91
00:06:29.852 --> 00:06:31.173
Freaky loves it!"

92
00:06:31.533 --> 00:06:32.193
Mog said.

93
00:06:32.213 --> 00:06:33.934
"And you know what?"

94
00:06:34.874 --> 00:06:37.316
Mog cocked his head and stared at the painting.

95
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:41.741
"I like it too.

96
00:06:42.703 --> 00:06:44.625
I think it captures his personality."

97
00:06:44.645 --> 00:06:47.389
"I guess Ms.

98
00:06:47.429 --> 00:06:49.852
Van Ghoul was right," Ben whispered to Winnie.

99
00:06:49.872 --> 00:06:52.316
"Beauty is in the eye of the beholder!"
